{% comment %}
  templates/page.shipping-policy.liquid
  Premium, custom-designed page template for Zybuds Shipping Policy.
{% endcomment %}

<style>
  .policy-container {
    max-width: 840px;
    margin: 40px auto;
    padding: 50px 40px;
    background: var(--bg3);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }
  .policy-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .policy-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 42px);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--white);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .policy-meta {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .policy-notice {
    padding: 16px 20px;
    background: rgba(232, 201, 122, 0.03);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 35px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink2);
  }
  .policy-content h2 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(18px, 2.2vw, 22px);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--white);
    margin-top: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .policy-content h3 {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-top: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .policy-content p {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: var(--ink2);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .policy-content ul {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    padding-left: 20px;
  }
  .policy-content li {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--ink2);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    list-style-type: square;
  }
  .shipping-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    margin: 24px 0;
  }
  .shipping-card {
    background: var(--bg2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 20px;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .shipping-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: var(--border2);
  }
  .shipping-card-title {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--white);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .shipping-card-value {
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .shipping-card-desc {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .policy-contact-card {
    background: var(--bg2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 24px;
    margin-top: 30px;
  }
  .policy-contact-card p {
    margin-bottom: 12px !important;
  }
  .policy-contact-card p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0 !important;
  }
  .policy-contact-card strong {
    color: var(--white);
  }
  .support-box {
    padding: 18px 22px;
    background: rgba(76, 175, 110, 0.03);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--green);
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin: 24px 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink2);
  }
  .support-box strong {
    color: var(--white);
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .policy-container {
      margin: 20px 12px;
      padding: 30px 20px;
    }
  }
</style>

<div class="policy-container">
  <div class="policy-header">
    <h1 class="policy-title">Shipping Policy</h1>
    <div class="policy-meta">Last updated: June 1, 2026</div>
  </div>

  <div class="policy-notice">
    Thank you for shopping at <strong>Zybuds</strong>. We operate a highly optimized logistics framework to process and deliver your audio gear safely and swiftly.
  </div>

  <div class="policy-content">
    <h2>Order Processing Time</h2>
    <p>All orders are processed within <strong>1-2 business days</strong> (excluding weekends and holidays).</p>
    <p>You will receive a confirmation email with your order details once the order is placed.</p>

    <h2>Shipping Rates and Delivery Times</h2>
    <p>We offer the following shipping and delivery options:</p>

    <div class="shipping-grid">
      <div class="shipping-card">
        <div class="shipping-card-title">📦 Standard Shipping</div>
        <div class="shipping-card-value">5-7 Business Days</div>
        <div class="shipping-card-desc">Reliable ground shipping across major Indian pin codes.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="shipping-card">
        <div class="shipping-card-title">⚡ Express Shipping</div>
        <div class="shipping-card-value">2-4 Business Days</div>
        <div class="shipping-card-desc">Priority air shipping for rapid delivery.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="shipping-card">
        <div class="shipping-card-title">💵 Cash on Delivery (COD)</div>
        <div class="shipping-card-value">Available</div>
        <div class="shipping-card-desc">Pay at your doorstep. Available on orders within India.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>Order Tracking</h2>
    <p>Once your order is shipped, you will receive a tracking number via email or WhatsApp (if provided during checkout).</p>
    <p>You can track your order using the tracking link provided or through our website under the "Track Order" section.</p>

    <h2>Shipping Locations</h2>
    <p>Currently, we ship exclusively within <strong>India</strong>.</p>

    <h2>Delays and Issues</h2>
    <p>Delivery times may vary due to unforeseen circumstances like weather, strikes, or courier issues.</p>
    
    <div class="support-box">
      <strong>Need Urgent Logistics Assistance?</strong><br>
      If your order is delayed, please contact our escalation desk at 
      <a href="mailto:maheshchimataeng111@gmail.com" style="color:var(--accent); font-weight:600;">maheshchimataeng111@gmail.com</a> 
      or call us at 
      <a href="tel:6300680765" style="color:var(--accent); font-weight:600;">6300680765</a>.
    </div>

    <h2>Damaged or Lost Packages</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Damaged Packages:</strong> If your order arrives damaged, please email us within <strong>48 hours</strong> of receiving it with photos of the damage.</li>
      <li><strong>Lost Packages:</strong> Contact us immediately, and we will work with our courier partner to resolve the issue as fast as possible.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>For questions or concerns regarding shipping, reach out to us at:</p>

    <div class="policy-contact-card">
      <p><strong>✉️ Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:ganimedia1@gmail.com" style="color:var(--accent);">ganimedia1@gmail.com</a></p>
      <p><strong>📞 Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:9704252065" style="color:var(--accent);">9704252065</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
